---
import PageShell from '../../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Hypothetical: Botox landing trust rebuild | Educational breakdown';
const seoDesc =
	'Illustrates content hierarchy for toxin education—fabricated storyline to train marketing literacy, zero patient data.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>How illustrative Botox copy can rebuild exploratory trust</h1>
	<p>
		In a fictional scenario Clinic V notices scroll depth collapsing mid FAQ. Editors hypothesize the page prematurely
		surfaces price anchoring instead of clinician candidacy reassurance.
	</p>
	<h2>Structural teaching points</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Defer pricing tables until expectation alignment paragraphs exist.</li>
		<li>Surface provider specificity (credentialing permissible to disclose) adjacent to toxin mention.</li>
		<li>Cross-link resurfacing FAQs for hesitant patients debating combination strategies.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>This remains educational theory—measurable validation requires ethically collected analytics.</p>
</PageShell>
